{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41916","headline":"下蔡春偶作 · 李中","name":"下蔡春偶作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旅馆飘飘类断蓬，悠悠心绪有谁同。\n一宵风雨花飞後，万里乡关梦自通。\n多难不堪容鬓改，沃愁惟怕酒杯空。\n采兰扇沈何时遂，洗虑焚香叩上穹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}